---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="Skills | Jair M. Morales Magallon" description="What Jair M. Morales Magallon works with: HTML, CSS, JavaScript, Python, Java, Supabase, Firebase, Power BI, Git and GitHub, grouped by use." page="skills" scripts={["js/name-water.js"]}>
      <div class="wrap page-head">
        <p class="crumb">~/jair/skills</p>
        <h1 data-intro>What I work with</h1>
        <p class="lead" data-intro>Grouped by what I use each thing for, with the project where you can see it when there is one.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- HABILIDADES: cada skill-group es un area. Para agregar una habilidad, copia un <li> completo. -->
      <div class="wrap section-tight" data-intro>
        <section class="skill-group" aria-labelledby="skills-web">
          <div>
            <h2 id="skills-web">Building for the web</h2>
            <p>Where I spend most of my time.</p>
          </div>
          <ul class="skill-list">
            <li><h3>HTML and CSS</h3><p>Semantic, responsive layouts written by hand, with shared styles and variables so a site stays easy to change. This portfolio is built this way.</p></li>
            <li><h3>JavaScript</h3><p>Interaction and animation in the browser: guided story flows, particle systems and form handling. See <a href="projects.html">La Gran Noche and Feliz Navidad</a>.</p></li>
            <li><h3>UX and interface design</h3><p>Planning the flow and the look of a page so it fits the person or occasion it is for.</p></li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="skill-group" aria-labelledby="skills-languages">
          <div>
            <h2 id="skills-languages">Programming languages</h2>
            <p>For logic and problem solving beyond the browser.</p>
          </div>
          <ul class="skill-list">
            <li><h3>Python</h3><p>Certified with Python Essentials (PCEP) from Cisco Networking Academy and IT Specialist: Python from Certiport.</p></li>
            <li><h3>TypeScript</h3><p>JavaScript with types, for projects that need to grow without breaking.</p></li>
            <li><h3>Java</h3><p>Object-oriented programming.</p></li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="skill-group" aria-labelledby="skills-data">
          <div>
            <h2 id="skills-data">Data and back end</h2>
            <p>Where a site stops being static and starts remembering things.</p>
          </div>
          <ul class="skill-list">
            <li><h3>Flask, FastAPI and SQLAlchemy</h3><p>Back ends and APIs written in Python, connected to databases with SQLAlchemy.</p></li>
            <li><h3>Supabase</h3><p>Stores the RSVPs and guest messages for <a href="projects.html">La Gran Noche</a>, with the table structure written in SQL.</p></li>
            <li><h3>Firebase</h3><p>Database and authentication for web projects.</p></li>
            <li><h3>Databases</h3><p>Designing tables and querying them with SQL.</p></li>
            <li><h3>Power BI</h3><p>Turning raw data into reports and dashboards.</p></li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="skill-group" aria-labelledby="skills-tools">
          <div>
            <h2 id="skills-tools">Tools and workflow</h2>
            <p>How the work gets saved, shared and published.</p>
          </div>
          <ul class="skill-list">
            <li><h3>Git and GitHub</h3><p>Version control for every project. My public work is on <a href="https://github.com/JMMM11" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a> and deployed with GitHub Pages.</p></li>
            <li><h3>Editors and design</h3><p>VS Code, IntelliJ IDEA and Figma.</p></li>
            <li><h3>Office suites</h3><p>Microsoft 365 and Google Workspace. Certified in Excel (Microsoft Office Specialist).</p></li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="skill-group" aria-labelledby="skills-people">
          <div>
            <h2 id="skills-people">Working with people</h2>
            <p>What teaching and customer service have taught me.</p>
          </div>
          <ul class="skill-list">
            <li><h3>Teaching</h3><p>Explaining programming to freshman, junior and senior groups at Centro ¡Supérate!.</p></li>
            <li><h3>Communication and teamwork</h3><p>Years of customer service and team projects.</p></li>
            <li><h3>Languages</h3><p>Spanish, native. English, upper-intermediate (B2, TOEIC).</p></li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="skill-group" aria-labelledby="skills-security">
          <div>
            <h2 id="skills-security">Security</h2>
            <p>What I am studying now.</p>
          </div>
          <ul class="skill-list">
            <!-- TODO: cuando tengas cursos, laboratorios o certificaciones de seguridad, agregalos aqui. -->
            <li><h3>Cybersecurity degree, in progress</h3><p>Universidad Tecnológica de Panamá.</p></li>
          </ul>
        </section>
      </div>
</Base>
